		\item[] \textit{University of Seville / RSME (Royal Spanish Mathematical Society)}
		\item[] \textbf{Role: Attendee.} Selected to participate in this conference for young researchers.
		\item[] \textit{Highlight:} Particular interest in plenary lectures by \textbf{Prof. Marithania Silvero} (Knot Theory) and \textbf{Prof. Alberto Rodríguez} (Differential Geometry/Topology), aligning with my research focus.
		
